# Wanting the network offline while a retry is pending cancels the retry.
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! closed error Connection refused
? notice Disconnected: Connection refused; reconnecting in 5 s
? next-wake 4.965s
! disconnect
? desired offline
? next-wake none
@ +600s
? offline user-quit
